{"id":28460,"author":"K_R_Cord","body":"\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n\u0026quot;Helvetica\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;sans-serif\u0026quot;\"\u003eHappy Friday,\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n\u0026quot;Helvetica\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;sans-serif\u0026quot;\"\u003eOur update is a little different today because this isn’t a developer update; this is an update for the server. \u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n\u0026quot;Helvetica\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;sans-serif\u0026quot;\"\u003eStarting this Sunday, there will be a Nebula server that will open up and will play a 100% throwback maps rotation. This rotation will change slightly every week to include other favorite maps or long and forgotten maps. The server itself will open at 12 Pm EDT and close in six hours after at 6 Pm EDT. If this proves to be a popular event we will add more hours and even expand the days. Here is the first week rotation:\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n\u0026quot;Helvetica\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;sans-serif\u0026quot;\"\u003eQuintus Origins\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n\u0026quot;Helvetica\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;sans-serif\u0026quot;\"\u003eHalcyon\u003co:p\u003e\u003c/o:p\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp class=\"MsoNormal\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size:10.5pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n\u0026quot;Helvetica\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;sans-serif\u0026quot;\"\u0